+/// 攻方说「根之后的记录归到下一次发布」：在新建文件之后再接一次覆盖写（有下一次发布）的历史上，只把 txg 3 那次发布的根挪到它的两条记录之前。
+fn investigate_order_with_a_next_publish(output: &mut ResultLines) -> i32 {
+    let content = common::file_content();
+    let mut pool = build_first_stream_in_memory(&content);
+    let overwrite_content: Vec<u8> = (0..4100).map(|index| u8::try_from((index * 7 + 3) % 253).expect("字节")).collect();
+    overwrite_in_memory(&mut pool, &overwrite_content);
+    let full = History::of_pool(&pool, Vec::new());
+    let roots: Vec<usize> = full.writes.iter().enumerate().filter(|(_, w)| w.kind == StepKind::RootRecordFua).map(|(i, _)| i).collect();
+    output.line(format!("name=investigate_order_next roots={roots:?} write_count={}", full.writes.len()));
+    let root_txg3 = roots[2];
+    let records_txg3: Vec<usize> = (0..root_txg3).rev().take_while(|i| full.writes[*i].kind == StepKind::JournalRecord).collect();
+    let mut order: Vec<usize> = (0..full.writes.len()).filter(|i| *i != root_txg3 && !records_txg3.contains(i)).collect();
+    let insert_at = order.iter().position(|i| *i > root_txg3).expect("根之后还有写");
+    let mut moved = vec![root_txg3];
+    moved.extend(records_txg3.iter().rev().copied());
+    for (offset, index) in moved.iter().enumerate() {
+        order.insert(insert_at + offset, *index);
+    }
+    let writes: Vec<RetainedWrite> = order.iter().map(|i| full.writes[*i].clone()).collect();
+    output.line(format!("name=investigate_order_next stream=healthy {}", describe_publishes(&full.writes)));
+    output.line(format!("name=investigate_order_next stream=txg3_root_before_its_records {}", describe_publishes(&writes)));
+    let mutant = History { base: full.base.clone(), writes, segments: Vec::new(), versions: Vec::new() };
+    // 状态：txg 3 的根及之前全持久，txg 3 的两条记录与之后的写全没持久。
+    let absent: BTreeSet<usize> = records_txg3.iter().copied().chain((root_txg3 + 1)..full.writes.len()).collect();
+    let persisted: Vec<bool> = order.iter().map(|original| !absent.contains(original)).collect();
+    let image = CrashImage { base: &mutant.base, writes: &mutant.writes, persisted: persisted.clone() };
+    let consulted = recover(&image, JournalPolicy::Consult);
+    let records = singlefs_checker_tier::crash::check_records_against(&image, &image, &mutant.writes, &persisted, singlefs_harness::memory_pool::RecordStreamContinuity::OneRecording, consulted.effective_root);
+    output.line(format!("name=investigate_order_next state=txg3_root_persisted_records_and_later_absent effective_root={:?} record_check={records:?}", consulted.effective_root));
+    0
+}
